// RETIRED — see the note on the Location model in schema.prisma. Kept mounted
// so anything still calling it keeps working, but nothing in the app does: the
// Location Master page now edits '/location-master' below. The LOC numbering
// series moved with it, so this route no longer auto-numbers — leaving it here
